package lattice:plugin-host@0.1.0;

/// Mirrors `EventBus::subscribe` + the `Event` enum (lattice-runtime). The
/// host owns the mpsc and delivers each serialized `Event` to the guest's
/// `on-event` export as a separate task (a slow handler never delays other
/// subscribers, §5.10.4). `:autocmd` from a plugin desugars to `subscribe`.
/// Fills the reserved `SubscriptionTarget::Plugin` variant. Populated in PH7.8.
/// (Before-class veto/mutation stays out — the bus is observation-only in v1.)
interface events {}
